===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|-}}

# {{physiology}} A watery or thin discharge of [[serum]] or [[mucus]], especially from the [[eye]]s or [[nose]].
#* '''1916''': He wore about his shoulders a heavy cloak; his pale face was drawn and his voice broken with '''rheum'''. - [[w:James Joyce|James Joyce]], ''[[w:Portrait of the Artist as a Young Man|Portrait of the Artist as a Young Man]] (Macmillan Press Ltd, paperback, 102)

